msgid ""
"verl 仓库使用 GitHub Actions 作为 CI 平台，通过分层测试架构保障代码质量与系统稳定性。\n"
"NPU 相关的工作流主要包括：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The verl repository uses GitHub Actions as the CI platform and ensures code quality and system stability through a layered testing architecture.\n"
"NPU-related workflows mainly include:\n"
""

msgid ""
"* ``npu_unit_test.yml``：运行单元测试。\n"
"* 以 ``_ascend.yml`` 结尾的文件：运行针对 Ascend NPU 的端到端测试或专项测试。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* ``npu_unit_test.yml``: Runs unit tests.\n"
"* Files ending with ``_ascend.yml``: Run end-to-end tests or specific tests targeting Ascend NPUs.\n"
""

